{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-adolescent-brain","revision":1,"title_en":"The Adolescent Brain Is Literally Awesome","title_zh":"青春期大脑真的很惊艳","level":"B1","primary_topic":"psychology_science","tags":["science","neuroscience","adolescence"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"青春期是童年通向成年的桥梁。现代脑成像研究表明，人类大脑发育会一直持续到二十多岁。青春期期间，灰质逐渐减少反映了神经突触连接的精细修剪，而白质纤维的增加支持了大脑跨区域的高速通信。科学家指出，情绪社交脑区与理性规划脑区可能具有不同的发育时间线，这或能解释青少年对新鲜体验的渴望，但个体差异非常显著。充满可塑性的大脑为青少年提供了探索与学习的黄金机遇。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T12:55:44Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Adolescence is the bridge between childhood and adulthood.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"青春期是童年通向成年的桥梁。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":11,"surface":"Adolescence","lemma":"adolescence","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"青春期"},{"start":12,"end":14,"surface":"is","lemma":"be","pos":"系动词","gloss_zh":"是"},{"start":15,"end":18,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这座"},{"start":19,"end":25,"surface":"bridge","lemma":"bridge","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"桥梁"},{"start":26,"end":33,"surface":"between","lemma":"between","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……之间"},{"start":34,"end":43,"surface":"childhood","lemma":"childhood","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"童年"},{"start":44,"end":47,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"和"},{"start":48,"end":57,"surface":"adulthood","lemma":"adulthood","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"成年"}],"phrases":[{"start":26,"end":57,"surface":"between childhood and adulthood","gloss_zh":"在童年与成年之间"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"While changes in height and voice are easy to notice, remarkable transformations also happen inside the head.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"虽然身高和嗓音的变化显而易见，但大脑内部也在发生着惊人的转变。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":5,"surface":"While","lemma":"while","pos":"从属连词","gloss_zh":"虽然"},{"start":6,"end":13,"surface":"changes","lemma":"change","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"变化"},{"start":14,"end":16,"surface":"in","lemma":"in","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……方面"},{"start":17,"end":23,"surface":"height","